      "document_text": "Kraken MTF (Crypto Facilities Ltd) offers perpetual and fixed-maturity linear derivatives margined and cash settled in USD. Perpetuals have no expiry; fixed maturities include weekly, monthly, quarterly and semiannual contracts. Perpetual symbols use PF; dated contracts use FF plus YYMMDD. Trading is 24/7 excluding maintenance; minimum lot is denominated in base currency and there is no traditional futures multiplier. Mark price is Index Price + EMA30s(Impact Mid Price - Index Price); the page describes maturity-basis treatment. The real-time index updates each second. Perpetual funding is calculated hourly from premium versus index; positive premium means longs pay shorts, negative premium means shorts pay longs. Funding settles hourly in USD or when net position changes. The page gives a permitted hourly funding range of -0.5% to +0.5%, funding multiplier n=8, and says maintenance margin is always half of initial margin. Contract-specific margin categories and product tables apply; examples include BTC 100x and lower leverage classes. Fixed-maturity contracts cash settle in USD at 08:00 UTC on last trading day. The article states last updated 16 June 2026.",
